arries the potential for stylistic or structural convergence, compliance re=
garding public performance, collecting societies (e.g., ZAiKS, GEMA, PRS, A=
SCAP), and sublicensing depends on local legal frameworks and judicial prac=
tices. We advise users to evaluate these aspects according to their specifi=
c target jurisdictions.

To help us better understand your integration needs and evaluate suitable A=
PI tiering, could you please share a bit more detail on the following?
1. Application Scenario:=C2=A0Briefly describe how Mureka API will be integ=
