2. Expected Generation Volume:=C2=A0What is your estimated daily average mu=
sic generation volume (or API calls per day)?
3. Projected Budget:=C2=A0Your expected monthly budget for API usage once l=
aunched.

Looking forward to your reply!

Best regards,
Mureka API Team
